name comicneue
category Package
revision 54891
shortdesc Use Comic Neue with TeX(-alike) systems
longdesc Comic Neue is a well-known redesign of the (in)famous Comic
longdesc Sans font. The package provides the original OpenType font for
longdesc XeTeX and LuaTeX users, and also has converted Type1 files for
longdesc pdfTeX users. Issues with this package can be reported on
longdesc GitHub or emailed to tex@slxh.nl.
execute addMap ComicNeue.map
execute addMap ComicNeueAngular.map
containersize 872884
